{
  "events": [
    {
      "tStartMs": 1176,
      "dDurationMs": 4650,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "2026 is really AI's takeoff\nyear, and I think there are"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 6106,
      "dDurationMs": 1561,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "three trends to be watching."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 7667,
      "dDurationMs": 5890,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "So if you want to separate the signal from\nthe noise, watch what's happening in terms"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 13557,
      "dDurationMs": 2760,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "of capability as well as competition."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 16737,
      "dDurationMs": 4710,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And by the former, I mean what's happening\nat the frontier of what AI is able to do."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 21817,
      "dDurationMs": 2240,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "The capability is accelerating."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 24067,
      "dDurationMs": 4090,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "For over a decade, we've heard\nabout how AI is gonna hit a wall."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 28737,
      "dDurationMs": 2150,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "That certainly does not\nseem to be the case."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 30967,
      "dDurationMs": 4150,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "The capability is not only accelerating,\nbut the competition, the second"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 35157,
      "dDurationMs": 5430,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "part, is leading to this intense\nreordering of the geopolitical order."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 40587,
      "dDurationMs": 3570,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And by competition, I'm not only talking\nabout the competition between the labs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 44157,
      "dDurationMs": 3930,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Of course, there's fierce competition\nbetween the labs, but really how this is"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 48087,
      "dDurationMs": 3470,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "a geopolitical competition, which I think\nis gonna be the definitive geopolitical"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 51777,
      "dDurationMs": 1920,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "competition of the twenty-first century."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 53897,
      "dDurationMs": 2390,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "Because ultimately,\nwhat are we doing here?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 56487,
      "dDurationMs": 5050,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "We are manufacturing non-biological\nintelligence, and those who are"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 61557,
      "dDurationMs": 4330,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "able to control the production and\ndeployment of that intelligence are"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 65887,
      "dDurationMs": 4395,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "gonna have an extreme and compounding\nedge, both economically as well"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 70282,
      "dDurationMs": 1310,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "as from a security perspective."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 71642,
      "dDurationMs": 4410,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "So as the capability accelerates,\nthe competition accelerates, too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 76232,
      "dDurationMs": 2320,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "And then there's a third category\nsignal we should be looking at,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 78602,
      "dDurationMs": 1230,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "and those are the constraints."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 79852,
      "dDurationMs": 5030,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "this is going to be decisive for both the\ncapability as well as the competition."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 85082,
      "dDurationMs": 3160,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "When it comes to the constraints, we\nknow about the physical constraints."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tStartMs": 88242,
      "dDurationMs": 5850,
      "segs": [
        {
          "utf8": "We know how non-biological intelligence\nis an industrial production and supply"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
